# Vulnerabilities accepted by the release image scan (.github/workflows/release.yml).
# One entry per line: the vulnerability id, a reason in a comment above it, and an expiry date, for example
#   # Not reachable: the application never renders XSLT views. Owner: backend. Review by 2027-01-31.
#   CVE-2026-00000 exp:2027-01-31
# Prefer upgrading the dependency or base image; an entry is a dated exception, not a fix.
